WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.350 --> 00:00:04.434
MDAAI is a repository-based protocol for human-directed AI

2
00:00:04.434 --> 00:00:04.944
development.

3
00:00:05.164 --> 00:00:09.222
Ordinary files define what an agent may change, what work is current,

4
00:00:09.222 --> 00:00:11.251
and what evidence supports a result.

5
00:00:12.450 --> 00:00:16.183
The original template connects Project Elaboration to Work Orders and

6
00:00:16.183 --> 00:00:16.930
their registry.

7
00:00:17.150 --> 00:00:21.808
Corrective Work Orders explain errors. Architecture decisions explain

8
00:00:21.808 --> 00:00:24.137
choices. Checkpoints capture milestones.

9
00:00:24.357 --> 00:00:28.592
Its Work Order editing rules conflict; adopters must reconcile them.

10
00:00:29.783 --> 00:00:33.859
Two point zero keeps a root operating contract and five governance

11
00:00:33.859 --> 00:00:34.230
documents.

12
00:00:34.450 --> 00:00:38.583
Project Elaboration owns scope and sequence. TASKS dot JSON is the

13
00:00:38.583 --> 00:00:40.462
single owner of task state.

14
00:00:40.682 --> 00:00:43.581
An optional Claude file only points to the contract.

15
00:00:44.783 --> 00:00:49.005
Read the contract, assigned task, scope, and relevant rules.

16
00:00:49.225 --> 00:00:53.165
The task links to scope and evidence. Its owner updates the active

17
00:00:53.165 --> 00:00:55.135
row, not a second status list.

18
00:00:55.355 --> 00:00:57.975
Add a decision or durable record only when needed.

19
00:00:59.150 --> 00:01:03.703
For a status endpoint, confirm scope, change code and tests, then

20
00:01:03.703 --> 00:01:04.945
collect real results.

21
00:01:05.165 --> 00:01:08.992
Update the task with evidence and the next action. Complete it only

22
00:01:08.992 --> 00:01:10.268
when acceptance is supported.

23
00:01:10.488 --> 00:01:13.597
Preserve that terminal result; link later corrections.

24
00:01:14.783 --> 00:01:18.587
The practical change is less routine paperwork, not less

25
00:01:18.587 --> 00:01:19.010
accountability.

26
00:01:19.230 --> 00:01:24.319
Adopt project by project: reconcile old rules, start a fresh registry,

27
00:01:24.319 --> 00:01:26.169
and preserve completed history.

28
00:01:26.389 --> 00:01:30.066
These instructions guide behavior. They do not automatically enforce

29
00:01:30.066 --> 00:01:30.474
it.
